{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0054_1002_051tmg", "source_sha256": "3acc6dcc4e97d99371cbcbb0ac73ca63a1c7d2e050f0c80e666f8248367c727f", "ja": "ひっ！　……な、{$P$}？\nいつからそこで覗き見を？", "zh": "哇！什么……{$P$}？\n你什么时候在那边偷看的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0054_1003_p", "source_sha256": "409f021b4583568f739b85c61abd069952c3be34e9df5e6efb57b96ec491d277", "ja": "いや、覗きじゃなくて堂々と見てたつもりだが……\n相当集中してたみたいだな。", "zh": "没有，我不是偷看，是正大光明地看……\n看来你真的很专心在试装。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0054_1004_051tmg", "source_sha256": "014452be7e8ff7ebffe04995b33db0ac221472bb716ed5cae9e27b5dcb01672d", "ja": "それは……当然のことです。PVの撮影のために、\nこんなに素敵なお衣装までいただいたのですから。", "zh": "那是……当然的。毕竟为了拍摄PV，\n特地帮我准备了这么美丽的服装。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0054_1005_051tmg", "source_sha256": "5cbb0bac18908c44341706c9db03e621e7426d5b06cc359f64e4f724444e371b", "ja": "大きな仕事であることは、私にもわかります。\nしっかり……がんばらんと……！", "zh": "连我都看得出来这次的工作有多么重要。\n所以我要……好好努力……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0054_1006_p", "source_sha256": "2b23817c5bb6c224c1d1b2cafd17012613b9e94cce6408c34317a5a82aca3c54", "ja": "そうか……。\nうーん、ちょっと失敗したかな？", "zh": "这样啊……\n嗯……好像有点失败呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0054_1007_051tmg", "source_sha256": "d1749fb6a0f6467e61c9b5045f9dc31d9a76c61c0e1ffbf767fb04ff0c896c90", "ja": "え？　な、何をですか？", "zh": "咦？是、是哪里失败呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0054_1008_p", "source_sha256": "583659917bd2fb159e8929501d6482fb2d8dd8fd7d5a7a84c32be9fdd151d75b", "ja": "いや、新しい衣装を着ることで、\n喜んでくれればと思ってたんだけど……。", "zh": "没有啦，我原以为你穿上新服装\n应该会很开心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0054_1009_051tmg", "source_sha256": "b6dd780f5d44cb8ac58e417334047b447644dbd7ab54d452c5155fe92986b9c2", "ja": "は？　貴方の目は、まさか本当に節穴なのですか？\n明らかに喜んでいる私の姿が、映っていないのですか？", "zh": "什么？请问你的眼睛没问题吗？\n我明明就这么开心，你难道看不出来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0054_1010_p", "source_sha256": "ebcb1bf5038668eb40373410030db97b80ce0d45711dff1f47b447eeef8905f1", "ja": "喜んでくれてるなら、いいんだけどな。\nあまり気合いを入れ過ぎないで、楽しんでいこう！", "zh": "你觉得开心的话，那就太好了。\n不用太紧张，轻松享受吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0054_1011_051tmg", "source_sha256": "ab51088ece3c01e9b8d62f4374bc43a6cd80a940a72f3fcc839c9c10d61561ef", "ja": "楽しんで……。\nまさか貴方は、年の瀬の空気に浮かれて……。", "zh": "享受……\n该不会是过年的气氛让你松懈了吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0054_1012_p", "source_sha256": "350fae5c0636273fedf1e0cdaa0a7603259da9655d23cc5f8e9817aa81e36efd", "ja": "違う違う！　俺はマジメだ、年末年始もフル稼働だ！\nでも紬には、楽しむことも忘れて欲しくないと思って。", "zh": "不是不是！我很认真，就连岁末年初都会卯足全力！\n我只是不希望䌷忘记享受工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0054_1013_p", "source_sha256": "cf393036beb27ac3ba4d9bd4c961093363c16e3821a9fd96908ae18487b534eb", "ja": "その方が、きっとPVにも\n可愛く映ると思うしな！", "zh": "要是能乐在其中，\n一定能拍出可爱的PV！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0054_1015_051tmg", "source_sha256": "18ba00800d2516bb210c1f43a5e2e6fe8b07e9cce0f674a09b2641b8ea4b79fb", "ja": "いつもながら、回りくどい物言いをなさることです。\n最初からそう言ってくだされば、素直に頷けたのに。", "zh": "你还是一如往常，讲话拐弯抹角的。\n要是一开始就这么说，我就能接受了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
