{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0054_1017_051tmg", "source_sha256": "cbee16ff918b1be3712bbdeeceb91d41847100f96c7d7ac8023123560cb60423", "ja": "まあ、仰りたいことはわかりました。\n確かに少々、力が入り過ぎていたかもしれません。", "zh": "不过，我明白你的意思了。\n或许我真的拚命过头了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0054_1018_051tmg", "source_sha256": "24278de53e79cfe2d9e73c674f78b4eca05991fd6bd8b5addb85d94143b66b47", "ja": "遠慮なく、楽しませていただこうと思います。\nお仕事も……。この、お衣装も。", "zh": "我会尽情享受的。\n无论是工作……或是这套服装。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
